cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Spatio-Temporal Crop Health Assessment for the Jammu Region
  using Multi-Source Remote Sensing and Machine Learning
message: >-
  If you use this software or methodology, please cite it
  using the metadata in this file.
